OL,5,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FThe team at Hull Royal Infirmary
OL,7,     Fhas another busy night: a man is
OL,8,     Finvolved in a motorbike collision
OL,9,     Fwith a deer and a young patient is
OL,10,     Fin agony with his ankle facing the
OL,11,     Fwrong way.
OL,12,G0000 Killer on the Run
OL,13,     FIn 2015, Amanda Taylor brutally
OL,14,     Fmurdered her father-in-law and
OL,15,     Ftook a selfie with the body. On
OL,16,     Fthe run and posting online, police
OL,17,     Fraced to stop her before she
OL,18,     Fkilled again.
