OL,5,G0100 Sleeping with My Murderer
OL,6,     FOn April 18th 1998, fruit and veg
OL,7,     Fentrepreneur Nat Fraser is acting
OL,8,     Fstrangely. When his wife of 10
OL,9,     Fyears disappears that day, police
OL,10,     Fbelieve they know why, but must
OL,11,     Fwork hard to prove it. (Ep3)
OL,12,G0200 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Adil tries to help a Glaswegian
OL,14,     Fhiding a large cyst under his hat
OL,15,     Fand Dr Dev long arms a lipoma from
OL,16,     Fa Lancashire detective. Dr Emma
OL,17,     Fcontends with lumps on a ribcage
OL,18,     Fand a cheek.
